%% Card authorization with 3-D Secure authentication.
sequenceDiagram
actor Shopper
participant Store
participant PSP
participant ACS
participant Issuer
Shopper->>Store: Place order
Store->>PSP: Authorize card
activate PSP
PSP->>ACS: Start 3DS
activate ACS
alt [challenge required]
ACS-->>Shopper: Challenge
Shopper->>ACS: OTP
ACS->>Issuer: Verify
Issuer-->>ACS: Result
else [frictionless]
ACS->>Issuer: Assess
Issuer-->>ACS: Result
end
ACS-->>PSP: CAVV and ECI
deactivate ACS
PSP->>Issuer: Authorization
Issuer-->>PSP: Approved or declined
PSP-->>Store: Result
deactivate PSP
Store-->>Shopper: Confirmation
Note over PSP,ACS: Authenticate before authorize
